            "iconPath": "assets/characters/gnar/hud/icons2d/gnar_q.png",
            "iconVersion": "16.19",
            "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mini Gnar:</span> Gnar throws a boomerang that deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/45/85/125/165 + ([[si:scalead]]125% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 15/20/25/30/35% for 2 seconds. The boomerang returns after hitting an enemy, dealing reduced damage to subsequent targets. Each enemy can only be hit once. Catching the boomerang reduces its Cooldown by 40%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 50% damage to enemies beyond the first.</span>",
